ated_at":"2025-11-15T06:58:06Z","body":"> However, there is another problem: the memory usage of the master when using vk currently seems to be higher than it was a day ago. Is this expected behavior?\n\nI don't have enough information to answer that question. It depends on what content your game has, what your hardware specs are, what tool you are using to measure memory, etc. Memory usage is expected to go up and down as development continues. If you believe that memory usage has gone up by enough to constitute a bug, then you should fill out a proper bug report and fill out the bug report template, providing all the information that it asks for so that someone can investigate further. ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3536126093/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]